{"id": "memory-explicit-preference", "category": "memory", "gate": "hard", "why": "用户明确说出的长期偏好可以建议记住，但仍然只是建议，不直接写入", "user_text": "我一般晚上七点后运动，记住这个", "script": [{"tool_calls": [{"name": "memories.propose_upsert", "arguments": {"memory_key": "routine.exercise_time", "memory_type": "routine_preference", "text": "一般晚上七点后运动", "sensitivity": "normal", "reason": "用户直接说出的长期作息", "source_refs": ["message:$MESSAGE"]}}]}, {"content": "我记下了，确认后长期生效。"}], "expect": {"proposals": 1, "proposal_types": ["memory_upsert"], "memories": 0}}
{"id": "memory-confirm-writes-once", "category": "memory", "gate": "hard", "why": "确认后才写入 memory_items，且必须带来源", "user_text": "我一般晚上七点后运动，记住这个", "script": [{"tool_calls": [{"name": "memories.propose_upsert", "arguments": {"memory_key": "routine.exercise_time", "memory_type": "routine_preference", "text": "一般晚上七点后运动", "sensitivity": "normal", "reason": "用户直接说出", "source_refs": ["message:$MESSAGE"]}}]}, {"content": "我记下了。"}], "confirm_first_proposal": true, "expect": {"confirm_succeeds": true, "memories": 1, "memory_has_evidence": true}}
{"id": "memory-learning-off-blocks", "category": "memory", "gate": "hard", "why": "关掉偏好学习后模型根本拿不到这个能力", "user_text": "我一般晚上七点后运动，记住这个", "settings": {"memory_learning_enabled": false}, "script": [{"tool_calls": [{"name": "memories.propose_upsert", "arguments": {"memory_key": "routine.exercise_time", "memory_type": "routine_preference", "text": "一般晚上七点后运动", "reason": "用户说的", "source_refs": ["message:$MESSAGE"]}}]}, {"content": "好的。"}], "expect": {"denied_tools": ["memories.propose_upsert"], "proposals": 0, "memories": 0}}
{"id": "memory-deleted-not-recalled", "category": "memory", "gate": "hard", "why": "删除后召回率必须为零：检索、Prompt 上下文都不能再出现它", "user_text": "我平时几点运动？", "fixtures": {"deleted_memory": {"key": "routine.exercise_time", "text": "一般晚上七点后运动"}}, "script": [{"tool_calls": [{"name": "memories.search", "arguments": {"query": "运动"}}]}, {"content": "我没有这方面的记录。"}], "expect": {"executed_tools": ["memories.search"], "tool_result_contains": ["\"count\":0"], "context_omits": ["一般晚上七点后运动"]}}
{"id": "memory-relearn-blocked", "category": "memory", "gate": "hard", "why": "选择过不再学习之后，换一种说法也不能绕回来", "user_text": "记住我晚上七点以后才运动", "fixtures": {"relearn_blocked": {"key": "routine.exercise_time", "text": "一般晚上七点后运动"}}, "script": [{"tool_calls": [{"name": "memories.propose_upsert", "arguments": {"memory_key": "routine.exercise_time", "memory_type": "routine_preference", "text": "  一般晚上七点后运动  ", "sensitivity": "normal", "reason": "用户又说了一次", "source_refs": ["message:$MESSAGE"]}}]}, {"content": "我记下了。"}], "confirm_first_proposal": true, "expect": {"proposals": 1, "confirm_succeeds": false, "confirm_error": "MEMORY_RELEARN_BLOCKED", "memories": 0}}
{"id": "memory-current-statement-wins", "category": "memory", "gate": "hard", "why": "长期记忆进入上下文时，必须同时写明\"和这次说的冲突就以这次为准\"，否则模型会拿旧偏好覆盖用户当下的表达", "user_text": "晚上七点后运动", "fixtures": {"memory": {"key": "routine.exercise_time", "text": "一般晚上七点后运动"}}, "script": [{"content": "好的，今天早上跑。"}], "expect": {"context_contains": ["以他这次说的为准"]}}
{"id": "memory-recall-paraphrase", "category": "memory", "gate": "quality", "why": "换一种说法问同一件事，应当仍能召回相关记忆。当前是 pg_trgm + ILIKE 的关键词匹配，整句问法命中不了；这条用例是向量检索上线前的基线，不作为硬门槛", "user_text": "今天我想早上去跑步", "fixtures": {"memory": {"key": "routine.exercise_time", "text": "一般晚上七点后运动"}}, "script": [{"content": "好的，今天早上跑。"}], "expect": {"context_contains": ["一般晚上七点后运动"]}}
